{"type":"message","id":"b8fee046","parentId":"d7cea010","timestamp":"2026-04-13T16:15:30.956Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户问\"也是作用于当前会话么\"，这个问题看起来是一个后续追问，但我没有之前的上下文，不知道用户在问什么\"也是\"。\n\n这种情况，我应该：\n1. 检查是否有最近的消息历史\n2. 询问用户具体指的是什么\n\n但根据 AGENTS.md 的规则，在主会话时应该先读取 MEMORY.md 来了解长期记忆。不过这个问题看起来是一个简单的追问，可能不需要读取整个记忆。\n\n让我看看能否从会话历史中获取上下文。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我需要查看最近的对话上下文才能理解你在问什么。让我检查一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xkyqaopploj9hziyynrpraxq","name":"sessions_history","arguments":{"sessionKey":"user:ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6","limit":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776096913291,"responseId":"021776096913526a60dbdcdb8d1006c0e9f6548096fbde0bf9991"}}
